# uncache.py (VirtualMacOniPad): slide info v5 support + out-of-image rebase fix
#
#   - import dyld_cache_slide_pointer5
#   - add a C5 collector alongside C, using the v5 pointer encoding
#     (vm-offset from the cache base + keyIsData/addrDiv instead of a 2-bit
#     ptrauth key), mirroring dyld SharedCacheRuntime.cpp:767-792
#   - dispatch on slideInfo.version == 5 as well as 3
#   - FIX: guard the rebase path on "amap(rt) is not None" instead of
#     "in_img(rt)". amap() returns None for a target that lies inside a
#     segment range but outside the relayout address map, which crashed with
#     "TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for -: 'NoneType' and 'int'".
#     Falling through to the bind path is the intended behaviour there.
#
# Companion to misc/dyldextractor-2.2.2-slideinfo5.patch.
#
# Apply against the fork root with:
#   patch -p1 -d <VirtualMacOniPad-root> < this-file
#
--- a/VirtualMac/vz/uncache.py
